# Mascot source-art library (master SVGs + manifest + avatars + tokens are versioned).
# The large PNG renders are print-only — the app serves SVG (ARCHITECTURE §10) — so they're not versioned.
# Exception: logo/ wordmark PNGs ARE versioned — the SVGs contain live text in Nunito 900, so the
# font-burned-in PNGs are the only logo form that works where the font isn't loaded (email, docs).
png/
*.png
!logo/*.png
.DS_Store
